					<p class="c-hero__intro">
						When your app and team <em>outgrow their DIY phase</em>, we build the tools and processes
						that keep your people happy and product &amp; growth moving together.
					</p>
					<div class="c-hero__actions">
						<a class="c-btn c-btn--aqua" href={links.bookCall}>Book a call</a>
						<a class="c-textlink" href="#c-offer">The Offer <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="c-hero__symbol" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="c-shape c-shape--pink"></span>
					<span class="c-shape c-shape--outline"></span>
					<span class="c-shape c-shape--aqua"></span>
