				></span> and <span class="c-nowrap">Japan<span class="c-clock" data-clock="Asia/Tokyo" aria-hidden="true"
					><svg class="c-clock__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span class="c-clock__time"></span></span
				>,</span> working globally 🌏.
